  "_doc": "Expansion 1 (Vharlen). The biggest lurker in the fen, who rules a hot mud wallow. His WALLOW in the middle of the arena heals him while he sits in it — the tank must drag him out of it. He slaps (cone), lobs sucking mud that holds you in place, and rolls down a line. At 60% his toads come to help. At 30% he sinks and sends mud geysers up under everyone, and a get-in-close ring of mud.",
  "party": "Open world elite. Solo: tough — keep him out of the wallow. 2-3: intended. 5+: quick. M5 scaling: health by players tagged; toads 3 -> 4 at five; mud lobs +1 per extra player.",
